    details: "pg 2, col 2",
    sourceDate: "1869-09-19",
    summary: "In 19th-century pugilism, English champion Jem Mace arrives in New York, joining Tom Allen and Jim Coyne for a sparring exhibition, with plans to reach St. Louis.",
    link: "http://statehistoricalsocietyofmissouri.org/cdm/ref/collection/dmr3/id/1237",
