    localCopyFull: "images/articles/image-037b.jpg",
    id: "037",
    text: "Tom Allen would be happy to see his friends this evening at his place, No. 417 Washington Avenue, and he has set things in gay and happy order for their coming. Tom will occupy the chair himself, and dispense refreshments appropriate to the season. The occasion will be a \"free and easy\" one, and all who go will bear away a happy memory."
