    id: "205",
    text: "Tom Allen, retired champion pugilist of the world, died at the Baptist Hospital yesterday.\n\nAs the proprietor of \"The Champion's Rest\" at 615 Market Street, Tom Allen was known as the \"champion,\" and any man who dared call him the \"ex-champion\" had him to settle with.",
