    text: "= 7 ane oe\n\nATrmerep Su1crps—FaMILy TROUBLES. —Yesterday a\nman named Balthasar Stark attempted to cut his throat\nwithaknife. Hedrewthe weapon from one ear to the\nother, but it was too dull to sever the windpipe, and the\nman, alarmed at what he had done, ran to his sister’s\nhouse, No. 1118 Twelfth street, where he was taken care\nof. Dr. Schuable was called in, and pronounced the\nwound not dangerous. Domestic troubles caused the\nman to attempt to take his life.\n\nTom Atzen’s Cotors,—An admirer of the plucky\nEnglish pugilist, Tom Allen, has presented us\" with the\ncolors under which Tom fought on Tuesday last with\nGallagher. The ‘colors” are upon a silk handkerchief\nwith a white ground and blue border. In the center ig\nthe American Eagle surrounded by a circle of yellow\nstars, and holding in bis claws two American flags and a\ngreen branch. There is nothing English about the flag.\nTom claims to bean American citizen, and will hereafter\nfight under American colors.",
