    localCopyFull: "images/articles/image-500b.jpg",
    id: "500",
    text: "CARD FROM BEN. HOGAN,\n\nI noticed in yesterday morning’s Democrat\nanother of Tom Allen’s braggadocio challenges,\nin which he offers to fight me at any time within\nsix weeks. Allen well knows that for several\nweeks previous to our recent fight I was sutfer-\ning froma severe illness; thutI did not and\ncould not endure a proper course of training,\nand that on the day of the fightI was in no\ncondition to enter tae ring. But as he had\nboasted that I would not and dare not meet him\nin the ring, I resolved todo 80 at all hazards,\nanddid the best ITeould under the ecireum-\nstances. All who are acquainted with my con-\ndition know that it would be foolhardy in me to\nmake another match at present. But as soon\nas iny health improvesI will match myself,\nwith my own money, to tight Tom Allen or\nany one else, for from #1,000 to $2,500. I do not\nwishto underrate Tom Alien, but I think if he\nhad more muscle in his arms and less m his\ntongue he would bea much better man than\nhe is. BEN. HOGAN,\n\nChampion of America.",
    summary: "The St Louis Republic published Ben Hogan's response to Tom Allen's challenge, stating that Allen offers to fight within six weeks. Hogan noted that he was recovering from severe illness before their recent fight and did not have adequate training.",
