    text: "oT Ee RESP UT om SES eS ie\nTHE MANLY ART.\nOn Thursday Week Allen and Rooke will Meet\nin the Squared Circle.\nAll the Money Up—Gossip in Regard to\nthe Battle.\n\nFrom presént indications, the prize fight for the\nthampionship of America, between Tom Allen, of\nSt.Louis, of George Rooke, of Newark,N.J., is sure\n(0 take place next Thursday week, within fifty\nmiles of Pittsburg. The last deposit was put up at\nHarry Hill’s, in New York, on the ist, Rooke oe\n\nresent in person, while -Arthur Chambers an\nBilly Edwards attéeded to Alien’s interests. The\ntoss for the choice of the fighting ee was won\nby Arthur Chambers, on behalf of the St. Lonisan,\nwhich isa great pointin Allen’s favor. Private\nadvices received in this city yesterday, from Pitts-\nburg, state that\nALLEN",
