    text: "NN es ea a\nAllen and Goss.\n\nThe coming match between Tom Allen and\nJoe Goss for the championship of the world is\nexciting a good deal of attentionin sporting\ncircles. Tomreturned tothe city afew days\nago and at once began a systematic course of\nPenge under the supervision of Jack Mad-\n\nden. This week the champion and his trainer\nhave been at the Comique, where\n| they have had a nightly set-to\nwith the xloves. To-nizht is\ntheir last appearance, Tom having to devote\nhis entire attention to training henceforth.\nLast night during the performance, Otto Bur-\nbank stated that,.asthe impression had gone\nout that Tom Allen was to icave St. Louis, he\nwas requested to announce that, afterthe tight\nwas over, Tom would again make his head-\nquarters in this city.\neee er eee al",
