    text: "The Allen-Goss Mill.\nSpecial Dippatch to the Cincinuati Times.\nCrscrssaTi, August 4.—Tom Allcn, who is in\ntraining here to fight Joe Goss, has taken steps to\nmake his peace with the New York Clipper.\nNearly four years ago he wrote a card for a New\nYork paper replying to some strictures on him by\nthe Clipper in reference to a fight between Ex-\n“‘warls and Chambers, near Detroit, where he\n“acted asa second. That card contained words\noffensive to the Clipper, and it has taken revenge,\nexcluding Allen's name from its columvs ever\nsince. Allen is tired of such obscurity, and has\nWritten a full apology. saying he wrote his\noffensive card in haste and ill temper. The stake\nmoney for the fight bas been bg gerne by a St.\nLouis creditor in the hands of the st#xke-holder.\nThe defense will be that the money does not be-\nlong to Allen, but to Ben De Bar, of St. Louis.\na ieee",
