    text: "The Ring.\nBEN HOGAN'S LATEST BLUFF.\n\nNew York, September 21.—Ben Hogan, who\nwas licked by Tom Allen at Omaha for $2,000\nand the championship of America, and re-\ncently, in a book published by himself, styled\nhimseif the wickedest man in the world, has\nbeen converted by a brother lawyer of the\nGospel Temperance Society. Hogan — will\nlecture to-morrow night on religion, pugilism\nand soper sees and how he spent several\nfortunes in the saloons of St. Louis, Pittsburg,\nChicago and New York. ‘'I am now on the |\nright track, and mean to work for the Lord.\"’\nIle says he intends to convert Harry Hill, Bill\nHastings, Andy Sheehan and the Allens.\n\nTen-Pins. |\nTHE CHAMPIONS CHALLENGED. |\n\nThe Western Ten-Pin Club, champions of St. |\nLouis, have received a challenge from the La-\nfayette Park Club to rolla match game for the\nchampion pin. A committee, composed of\nWm. Weitzler, J. A. St. John and A. Storck,has\nbeen appointed to make all arrangements in\nbebalf of the Westerns. The Lafayette Club\ncan present by far tie strongest teau) the cham-\npions have ever had to contend against, and\nthe result is looked forward to with considera-\nble interest.",
