    localCopyFull: "images/articles/image-786b.jpg",
    id: "786",
    text: "—_—_—_—_—_—_—_—_——— Eee\nHE DOWNED TOM ALLEN,\n\nAnd Was Himself Downed by Billy\nZachritz Later tn the Day.\n\nLem McGregor, known somewhat in slug-\nring circles as “the St. Joe Kid,’ went into\nTom Allen’s saloon yesterday ‘morning, and,\nvetting into a difficulty with the ex-champion,\nsucceeded in knocking the old veteran down\nand punishing him to a considerable extent,\nFlushed with this victory, it is said, Mc-\nGregor went around town boasting that he\nsould “do up” any of the local fistic talent.\nBilly Zachritz ran across the trail of\nthe Kid while he was on this tour and\nimmediately began looking him up, finall\nmeeting him in Poolalley. <A fight cauowed\non the spot, and Zachritz got away with Mc-\nGregor completely, bystanders stating that\nhe polished the Kid of in great shape with-\nout receiving any punishmentin return, It\nis expected that a meeting between the two\nwill be arranged for an early date, anda\nprize tight will follow the event of yesterday.\n\nns\nQUADRUPLE SILVER-PLATED\nWARES.\n\n400 Butter Dishes, $2.50 to $10.\n\n850 Casters, $3 to $15.\n\n500 Ice Pitchers, $5 to $15.\n\n275 Cake Baskets, $3.50 to $16.\n\n190 Tea Sets, $15 to $75. ;\n\nAlso Fruit Sue, Bread Trays, Pudding\nDishes, ‘Tureens, Waiters, Cups, Ice: Tubs,\nSard Stands, Jewel Boxes and Candle-sticks.\n\nAll best qualities, warranted, and bear our\nLame.\n\nMERMOD& JACCARDJEWELRY CO.,,\nCor. Broadway and Locust.\nHARD TO KILL.",
