    text: "| Cannes International Regatta.\n|° CANNES. FRANCE, March 12.—The\n\nCannes international regatta opened here\nto-day. Ailsa and Britannia started over\nthe twenty-four-mile course, thrice around\na triangle. Britannia was three minttes\nahead at the end of the first round. Britan-\nnia won, tinishing ten minutes ahead of the\nAllsa.\n\nSporting Notes.\n\nTom Allen, retired champion pugilist of the\nworld, 619 Market street, Free concert every\nevening. Best of singers only engaged here.\n\nHarry Newmier, an English pugilist, who was\nin America a few years ago, is anxious to return\nand fight elther Tommy Ryan or Mysterious Billy\nSmith.\n\nVie Lathrop. of Boston, and TT. H. Russell, of\nSt. Louis, will play a 15)-point game of pool for\n$25 a side at the Beaumont billiard hall, 2609\nOlive street. to-night. The game will commence\nat 8:20 o'clock.\n\nAlfredo De Orn, the champion poo! player, ts fn\na precarious ecndition at Roosevelt Hospital, New\nYork. He has had another cperation performed\nupon him, and it is said that this has seriously\nundermined his onee robust constitution\n\nThe St. Matthew's foot-hall team has accepted\nthe challenge of the St. Pauls for the champion-\nship of the Sodality League, the game to he\nplayed to-morrow on the former's grounds, Fair-\nfax and Newstead avenues.\n\nGlossy white laundry is the surest sign of\nsuperiority and elegance, One hall of Amer-\n{can Ball Blue assists In obtaining same. Be\nsure you get the Genuine Article with red\nstripe on package.\n\nDEATH OF GEORGE...",
